o","role":"受降复官爵者","evidence":["gongsuntao-q-5970c8da65c81f28f9b5"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"年代未详","precision":"undated","basis":"本批仅记录原文时间表达，不由相邻纪年推算公元年。","evidence":["gongsuntao-q-5970c8da65c81f28f9b5"]},"ordering_evidence":"gongsuntao-q-5970c8da65c81f28f9b5","source_order":[8,314,240],"order":2100},{"id":"guanzhang-e-o027b","title":"马超韩遂结杨秋李堪成宜军潼关","accounts":[{"id":"guanzhang-e-o027b-account","label":"《关张马黄赵传第六》正文","text":"马超韩遂结杨秋李堪成宜军潼关","evidence":["guanzhang-e-o027b-q"]}],"participants":[{"person":"wudi-p0282","role":"起兵","evidence":["guanzhang-e-o027b-q"]},{"person":"wudi-p0048","role":"起兵","evidence":["guanzhang-e-o027b-q"]},{"person":"wudi-p0283","role":"结盟","evidence":["guanzhang-e-o027b-q"]},{"person":"wudi-p0284","role":"结盟","evidence":["guanzhang-e-o027b-q"]},{"person":"wudi-p0285","role":"结盟","evidence":["guanzhang-e-o027b-q"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"马腾入朝后","precision":"undated","basis":"保留本条时间表达，不据相邻段落自动补年。","evidence":["guanzhang-e-o027b-q"]},"ordering_evidence":"guanzhang-e-o027b-q","source_order":[36,113,"O027b"],"order":6887}],"persons":[{"id":"wudi-p0284","name":"李堪","evidence":["wudi-q-o130","guanzhang-q-o027","gongsuntao-q-5970c8da65c81f28f9b5"],"facts":[],"aliases":[],"mentions":[{"id":"wudi-m-o130-wudi-p0284","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["wudi-q-o130"]},{"id":"wudi-m-o132-wudi-p0284","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["wudi-q-o132"]},{"id":"guanzhang-m-o027-wudi-p0284","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["guanzhang-q-o027"]},{"id":"guanzhang-m-p018-wudi-p0284","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["guanzhang-q-p018"]}]}],"evidence":[{"id":"cuimao-q-33453425b6eebf4ac153","section":"chapter-012","block":"b-cd085f0bc2343b371c06","layer":"original","quote":"从西征马超。超破，军还","section_title":"崔毛徐何邢鲍司马传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0029.xhtml","index":188,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":11,"end":22},{"id":"cuimao-q-db2ebd12ac1479f03092","section":"chapter-012","block":"b-ecadc2b94d58e0bc3ac4","layer":"pei","quote":"从破马超等，子伯功为多。曹公常叹曰：‘子伯之计，孤不及也","attribution":"裴注·《吴书》","section_title":"崔毛徐何邢鲍司马传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0029.xhtml","index":103,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-4d3d422b1c33b802fc46","start":363,"end":391},{"id":"gongsuntao-q-5970c8da65c81f28f9b5","section":"chapter-008","block":"b-97eb311121e3002971a1","layer":"pei","quote":"时又有程银、侯选、李堪，皆河东人也；兴平之乱，各有众千余家。建安十六年，并与马超合。超破走，堪临阵死；银、选南入汉中，汉中破，诣太祖降，皆复官爵","attribution":"裴注·魏略","section_title":"二公孙陶四张传第八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0021.xhtml","index":313,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-866f31ffb4c5cf065e10","start":240,"end":312},{"id":"guanzhang-e-o027b-q","section":"chapter-036","block":"b-a61619bc3d31e8681d13","layer":"original","quote":"超既统众，遂与韩遂合从〖6〗；及杨秋、李堪、成宜等相结，进军至潼关〖7〗。","section_title":"关张马黄赵传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0078.xhtml","index":112,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":43,"end":80},{"id":"guanzhang-q-o027","section":"chapter-036","block":"b-a61619bc3d31e8681d13","layer":"original","quote":"后腾与韩遂不和，求还京畿。于是征为卫尉，以超为偏将军，封都亭侯〖5〗，领腾部曲。﹝一﹞超既统众，遂与韩遂合从〖6〗；及杨秋、李堪、成宜等相结，进军至潼关〖7〗。曹公与遂、超单马会语。超负其多力〖8〗，阴欲突前捉曹公；曹公左右将许褚瞋目盻之〖9〗，超乃不敢动。","section_title":"关张马黄赵传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0078.xhtml","index":112,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":129},{"id":"guanzhang-q-p018","section":"chapter-036","block":"b-107ac81294c6a7f9bb40","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝三﹞《典略》曰：“建安十六年，超与关中诸将侯选、程银、李堪、张横、梁兴、成宜、马玩、杨秋、韩遂等，凡十部，俱反；其众十万，同据河、潼，建列营阵。是岁，曹公西征，与超等战于河、渭之交，超等败走。超至安定，遂奔凉州。诏收灭超家属。超复败于陇上，后奔汉中，张鲁以为都讲祭酒，欲妻之以女。或谏鲁曰：‘有人若此不爱其亲，焉能爱人？’鲁乃止。初，超未反时，其小妇弟种，留三辅；及超败，种先入汉中。正旦，种上寿于超。超捶胸吐血曰：‘阖门百口，一旦同命，今二人相贺邪！’后数从鲁求兵，欲北取凉州；鲁遣往，无利。又鲁将杨（白）〔昂〕等（欲）〔数〕害其能，超遂从武都逃入氐中，转奔往蜀。是岁，建安十九年也。”","attribution":"《典略》","section_title":"关张马黄赵传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0078.xhtml","index":138,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-7c0270dd171b6d970305","start":0,"end":295},{"id":"liusima-q-1c8aa779ac389f7303e7","section":"chapter-015","block":"b-dfd76f5cb0dc84d92f59","layer":"original","quote":"后超反，既从太祖破超于华阴","section_title":"刘司马梁张温贾传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0035.xhtml","index":138,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":96,"end":109},{"id":"lizang-q-52876f56216b11500e33","section":"chapter-018","block":"b-77cf8e238c8aa2ff298d","layer":"original","quote":"太祖破超于渭南，德随超亡入汉阳，保冀城","section_title":"二李臧文吕许典二庞阎传第十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0041.xhtml","index":201,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":193,"end":212},{"id":"lizang-q-e521121329ff29a1cea8","section":"chapter-018","block":"b-2791e4960695e3d97a40","layer":"original","quote":"后数日会战，大破超等，褚身斩首级","section_title":"二李臧文吕许典二庞阎传第十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0041.xhtml","index":132,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":99,"end":115},{"id":"rensu-q-a18ae77e46bc0262e5cc","section":"chapter-016","block":"b-36d1f8224f3cec24b29a","layer":"original","quote":"韩遂、马超之叛也，弘农、冯翊，多举县邑以应之","section_title":"任苏杜郑仓传第十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0037.xhtml","index":112,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":220,"end":242},{"id":"wudi-e-o130a-q","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-88fa41196c51bffe126a","layer":"original","quote":"是时，关中诸将疑繇欲自袭〖1〗，马超遂与韩遂、杨秋、李堪、成宜等叛〖2〗。遣曹仁讨之，超等屯潼关〖3〗。公敕诸将：“关西兵精悍〖4〗，坚壁勿与战！”","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_001.xhtml","index":64,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":74},{"id":"wudi-e-o132b-q","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-e0f9191c7bec5bbb7c81","layer":"original","quote":"公乃与克日会战〖14〗，先以轻兵挑之。战良久，乃纵虎骑夹击〖15〗；大破之，斩成宜、李堪等。遂、超等走凉州〖16〗，杨秋奔安定〖17〗，关中平。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_001.xhtml","index":66,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":165,"end":237},{"id":"wudi-q-b-2dc1a34b174874acae8b","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-2dc1a34b174874acae8b","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗十六年：建安十六年（公元 211）。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_001.xhtml","index":54,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-889c5acff5776ef2f54b","start":0,"end":21},{"id":"wudi-q-o128","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-37e542ccc37d1632e170","layer":"original","quote":"十六年春正月〖1〗，﹝一﹞天子命公世子丕为五官中郎将〖2〗，置官属〖3〗；为丞相副。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_001.xhtml","index":51,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":42},{"id":"wudi-q-o130","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-88fa41196c51bffe126a","layer":"original","quote":"是时，关中诸将疑繇欲自袭〖1〗，马超遂与韩遂、杨秋、李堪、成宜等叛〖2〗。遣曹仁讨之，超等屯潼关〖3〗。公敕诸将：“关西兵精悍〖4〗，坚壁勿与战！”","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_001.xhtml","index":64,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":74},{"id":"wudi-q-o132","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-e0f9191c7bec5bbb7c81","layer":"original","quote":"九月，进军渡渭。﹝三﹞超等数挑战，又不许；固请割地，求送任子〖10〗。公用贾诩计〖11〗，伪许之。韩遂请与公相见；公与遂父同岁孝廉，又与遂同时侪辈，于是交马语移时。不及军事；但说京都旧故，拊手欢笑〖12〗。既罢，超等问遂：“公何言？”遂曰：“无所言也。”超等疑之。﹝四﹞他日，公又与遂书，多所点窜〖13〗，如遂改定者，超等愈疑遂。公乃与克日会战〖14〗，先以轻兵挑之。战良久，乃纵虎骑夹击〖15〗；大破之，斩成宜、李堪等。遂、超等走凉州〖16〗，杨秋奔安定〖17〗，关中平。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_001.xhtml","index":66,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":237}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
